 {
  "text": "Good morning, and welcome to the Corner Café. My name is Leo. Today's special is a coffee and a piece of chocolate cake, for six pounds. Our tea is from India, and it is very good with milk. Please order at the counter. Thank you, and have a nice day!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a6_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Here is a coffee tip for London. A white coffee is a coffee with milk. A black coffee is a coffee without milk. In a café, you order at the counter, and then you say your name. They write your name on the cup. So, say it slowly, or spell it!",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a6_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
